{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:19 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:19 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:19 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"私家車自炒撞鐵欄，司機無受傷。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7289f1e6b49d4e155160fc34f4deff7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_12.jpeg\"/><p>今(11日)中午1時許，一部白色私家車駛至將軍澳駿日街先進製造業中心對開，懷疑失控猛撞路邊鐵欄，約一米長鐵欄被撞毀，私家車車頭撞毀，幸司機無恙，因私家車橫亘在駿日街，交通一度受阻。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"私家車撞毀鐵欄。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9d70813ab9626d684de4fc30876c439/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_12_4__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車橫亘駿日街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd5d85558b149ca6b2c4bfdba93d2210/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c76ab9330a7559b6c9978bf3015bb846/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_12_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車車頭嚴重損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15d1c88365098462b521ac16e494d7e8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_12_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51bc55859cf012fe6f0b3dabc776e71b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_53_12_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.254745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:19:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:41.608821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:14.910805+00:00","content_hash":"e1a6eb754699b64420a1108b5084528899fb9ccffa79ef3b8551c316334b8ef9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}